{
  "slug": "brand-voice-guide-writing",
  "concept": "Brand Voice Guide Writing",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "Authoring craft for the brand voice guide as an artifact. The output is a document other writers will open, reference, and apply.",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Brand Voice Guide Writing",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Authoring craft for the brand voice guide as an artifact. The output is a document other writers will open, reference, and apply.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#brand-voice-guide-writing",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A brand voice guide answers four questions for every writer who opens it:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Who do we sound like? (Voice - the constant.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "How do we shift in different situations? (Tone - the variable.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Which words do we use, and which do we never use? (Vocabulary.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "What does this look like in practice? (Examples - usually do/don't pairs.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "If a guide doesn't make these four questions answerable in under 10 minutes of reading, it will be ignored.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. The four-section skeleton",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Voice - three to five attributes that describe the constant personality. State each as \"We are X. We are not Y.\" (Bloomstein's BrandSort framing: include the not.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#1-the-four-section-skeleton",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Tone - a matrix showing how voice flexes by situation.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#1-the-four-section-skeleton",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Vocabulary - preferred words, banned words, and grammar/style decisions specific to the brand.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#1-the-four-section-skeleton",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Examples - at least 5 do/don't pairs spanning the highest-traffic surfaces.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#1-the-four-section-skeleton",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Voice attributes — the \"we are X, we are not Y\" pattern",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The canonical format:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#2-voice-attributes-the-we-are-x-we-are-not-y-pattern",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> Confident, not arrogant. We make declarative claims when we know we're right. We don't oversell, hedge with weasel words, or talk down to readers who know less than us.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#2-voice-attributes-the-we-are-x-we-are-not-y-pattern",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> Warm, not saccharine. We sound like a competent colleague who likes their job. We don't use exclamation marks to perform enthusiasm or call readers \"friend.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#2-voice-attributes-the-we-are-x-we-are-not-y-pattern",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Three to five attributes is the sweet spot.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#2-voice-attributes-the-we-are-x-we-are-not-y-pattern",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. The brand-voice spectrum chart (typically 3 axes)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The Nielsen Norman Group axes: formal↔casual, serious↔funny, respectful↔irreverent, enthusiastic↔matter-of-fact.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#3-the-brand-voice-spectrum-chart-typically-3-axes",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Anti-pattern: Putting all markers in the middle. \"Moderately formal, moderately serious, moderately enthusiastic\" is no voice.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#3-the-brand-voice-spectrum-chart-typically-3-axes",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Do/don't pairs (the \"this but not that\" convention)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "> Do: \"We paused your build. Resume it when ready.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#5-dodont-pairs-the-this-but-not-that-convention",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "> Don't: \"Oops! Looks like your build got paused. No worries - just click Resume whenever you'd like to keep going! 🚀\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#5-dodont-pairs-the-this-but-not-that-convention",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The don't side teaches more than the do side. Pick don'ts from real drafts your team has actually shipped.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#5-dodont-pairs-the-this-but-not-that-convention",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Vocabulary section: preferred, banned, and decisions",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Preferred - words that carry the voice. (\"ship\" not \"release\"; \"you\" not \"the user\".)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#6-vocabulary-section-preferred-banned-and-decisions",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Banned - words that break the voice. (\"leverage\", \"synergy\", \"seamless\", \"robust\", \"delightful\", \"passionate\".)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#6-vocabulary-section-preferred-banned-and-decisions",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Decisions - product-name capitalization, oxford comma, contractions allowed, em dash vs en dash.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#6-vocabulary-section-preferred-banned-and-decisions",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Dating and versioning discipline",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Every voice guide should display:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#7-dating-and-versioning-discipline",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Version (semver or date)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#7-dating-and-versioning-discipline",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Last reviewed date",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#7-dating-and-versioning-discipline",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Owner (a person, not a team)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#7-dating-and-versioning-discipline",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Next review date (no more than 12 months out)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#7-dating-and-versioning-discipline",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "No \"we are not.\" Lists three positive attributes with no opposites.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Spectrum markers all centered. \"Moderately formal\" is no guidance.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't-side strawmen. Don't pairs that are obviously bad teach nothing.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "No date, no owner. Writers won't trust an undated guide.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "30+ page voice guide. Anything past 10 pages won't be read.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Banning words without preferring others. \"Don't say leverage\" without \"say use\" leaves writers stuck.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "No tone matrix. Writers can match personality but not situation.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/brand-voice-guide-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
